  "question": {
    "text": "The equivalent capacitance between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>, where two concentric spherical shells having radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math>&nbsp;are connected as shown in the figure.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0061_f8890aa1903a.jpeg\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 165px;\" />"
  },
